    <item>
      <title>雪佛龙在制裁之前命令掉头委内瑞拉石油</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-11/chevron-ordered-to-u-turn-venezuela-oil-ships-ahead-of-sanctions</link>
      <description><![CDATA[雪佛龙公司（Chevron Corp.）被命令将近100万桶委内瑞拉石油返回委内瑞拉SA，对石油专业的打击，该公司在5月份的美国制裁截止日期命中命中率之前一直致力于确保原油。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-11/chevron-ordered-to-u-turn-venezuela-oil-ships-ahead-of-sanctions</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Apr 2025 16:58:18 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>国库突然在警告特朗普的警告时突然交易像风险的资产</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-11/treasuries-suddenly-trade-like-risky-assets-in-warning-to-trump</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在华尔街的岩石固定安全性，美国国债债券在恐慌时期一直是投资者的第一次征收港口。他们在9/11的全球金融危机期间集会，即使在美国自己的信用等级也被削减时。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-11/treasuries-suddenly-trade-like-risky-assets-in-warning-to-trump</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Apr 2025 02:50:49 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
